msgctxt "192"
msgid "Listen up. We got Ayako's money back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid "Then you know who the thief is!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "Not so fast. I actually have to apologize to all of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid ""
"Well, Eri came to me yesterday saying she found some money,\r\n"
"but I guess it slipped my mind today."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "Seriously, Eri? Where'd you find it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Um, in the yard..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid "And how much was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "1,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "Which is exactly how much you were missing, right, Ayako?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Meaning there's a good chance the money Eri found yesterday\r\n"
"is the same money that went missing from Ayako's bag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "There's no other possibility! Don't you guys think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Hmmm, I guess..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Sounds about right to me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"So then nobody stole the money! Why was I getting blamed\r\n"
"for it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, Mitsuo. All of this could have been avoided\r\n"
"if I had just remembered sooner."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Everyone... I'm really sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "Sorry's not good enough!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid "Yeah, I got called a thief!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid "Yeah, me too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "Hold on, guys..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"Wait. I'm the one who dropped the money, so if you're\r\n"
"gonna get mad at anyone... get mad at me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid ""
"I... I should've said something sooner, too. I'm really\r\n"
"sorry, everyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"See? Uncle Kaz was just a little forgetful! I think we\r\n"
"should be glad none of us turned out to be thieves!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "Yeah, I guess... Sorry, Riona."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "And I'm sorry for suspecting you, Mitsuo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "Eh, whatever!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "I probably deserved it for how I treated Koji..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "Hey, it's all in the past now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"I'm just glad I got my money back! Though now I'm\r\n"
"realizing... I'm starving! When's dinner, Uncle Kaz!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "I wanna eat, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Me three!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Oh yeah! We totally forgot about dinner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "Right. Let's get moving."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "And make it snappy, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Heh, try not to eat the table while we're gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"Actually, why don't you all go play outside while we cook?\r\n"
"We'll come get you when it's ready."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Well, guess we better get started."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid "Come on, you two. Let's get back inside."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Huh? What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "924"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid ""
"Everyone's so angry... I wonder what they're gonna do when\r\n"
"they find out Eri took the money. I mean, Koji and Riona\r\n"
"are already fighting..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "What do we do, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "Hm..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Everyone's gonna hate me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"Nobody's going to hate anyone. I'll tell you what, leave\r\n"
"the talking to me. What I need you two to do is..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid "Got it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Mhm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Uncle Kaz."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Come on, let's get everyone in the dining room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Okay, I'll go round them up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "Me too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"(The only thing that accomplished was making everyone\r\n"
"doubt each other. Although... we'd be missing a lot more\r\n"
"than Ayako's money if the thief had come from outside.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"(So as much as I hate to admit it, one of the kids must\r\n"
"have stolen it. Guess the only option now is looking\r\n"
"through their things.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "...And that's pretty much all we know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid ""
"Ayako's really worried, and rightfully so. The money got\r\n"
"taken right out of her wallet, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1272"
msgid ""
"Now, I don't like doing this any more than you do... but if\r\n"
"one of you stole the money, I need you to speak up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1308"
msgid "Ayako. When did you first notice it was gone?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid "Umm, I think it was two days ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332"
msgid ""
"All right, then. Did any of you notice anything weird going\r\n"
"on? Were there any strangers hanging around or anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1344"
msgid ""
"Uh... I think I saw something. Riona was digging around\r\n"
"in Ayako's bag."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid "Riona?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid ""
"Ayako-chan said I could borrow her paint, so I was getting\r\n"
"it out of her bag! You don't think I stole the money... do you,\r\n"
"Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid ""
"Now that I think about it, didn't Mitsuo just buy a new\r\n"
"model set?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid ""
"It's a pretty fancy one, too. Kinda suspicious timing,\r\n"
"don't you think?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid ""
"Well, Mitsuo? How did you get the money for something\r\n"
"like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid ""
"Huh? I saved up for weeks, that's how! I didn't do anything\r\n"
"wrong, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440"
msgid "I even stopped buying snacks so I could save up quicker!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid ""
"Besides, don't they say the first guy to speak up is usually\r\n"
"the one who did it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid "What was that!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1488"
msgid "You heard me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1500"
msgid "Stop it, you two!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1512"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1524"
msgid "Uncle Kaz... What do we do?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid "All right, we're done here. This was clearly a mistake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1548"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "But somebody stole the money, right!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572"
msgid "Yeah, he's right!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1584"
msgid ""
"Look, we're not gonna keep sitting here flinging accusations\r\n"
"at each other. That's not what being a family is about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1596"
msgid ""
"But I'll say it again. If one of you did take the money,\r\n"
"you can come talk to me whenever you want. I won't tell\r\n"
"the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632"
msgid "(Well, that's everyone. Time to find out what happened.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692"
msgid "Hi, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "Hey, Haruka. How was school?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1716"
msgid "Good! Are the others back already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1728"
msgid "Yeah, they got home a while ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1740"
msgid "Shiro, too? I hope he's okay..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1752"
msgid "Don't worry, Haruka. Shiro's gonna be just fine."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1764"
msgid "Really? That's a relief!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776"
msgid ""
"I was so worried when I heard he was getting bullied...\r\n"
"But I'm glad everything's gonna be okay!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid "Me too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1800"
msgid "Well, I better go get dinner started!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1812"
msgid "Be careful with the knives!"
msgstr ""

